@startuml
title SA-F03 — Checkout and handoff
caption Fulfilment choice to handoff | PRD-07–09
start
:Customer reviews contact, fulfilment, time, items and terms;
if (Merchant arranges Lalamove?) then (yes)
 :Merchant verifies location, fee and time or offers an alternative;
 :Customer accepts current fee/time and total;
else (pickup or customer-arranged)
 :Show fixed pickup or external delivery terms;
endif
:Deduplicate order and coordinate acceptance with settlement;
if (Driver arrives?) then (yes)
 :Record arrival separately from preparation and handoff;
endif
if (Ready and successfully handed off?) then (yes)
 :Record time and complete;
else (not fulfilled)
 :Record incident and manually arrange next action;
endif
stop
@enduml
